Conjures a furious, raging lightning storm with a radius of 6 that follows you as long as this spell is active.

Each turn, a random lightning bolt will hit up to [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] of your foes for 1.00 to [47, 63, 75, 86, 95 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage ([23, 31, 38, 43, 48 (TL1-5; SP 100)] average) in a radius of 1.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
